abstract: >-
  Enterprise-grade operational data governance, 4-tier DORS reconciliation,
  and sub-100ms law enforcement analytics platform engineered for Biro
  Pembinaan dan Operasional (Robinopsnal) Bareskrim Polri, managing over
  68.89 million live relational records across Mabes Polri, 36 Polda,
  508+ Polres, and 4,900+ Polsek nationwide.
